        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A microphone is required to play MIMESIS.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For the best experience, we recommend using a headset or earphones and playing with four players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >================================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>MIMESIS</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIMESIS is a 4-player online co-op horror game where monsters imitate your friends. Gather anything of value and get back to the tram, never quite certain whether the person beside you is a real friend or a monster wearing their face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=1084 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Trust your friends. But doubt them.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Threats are scattered all through the building. Together with your friends you can push past the danger and haul your findings back safely. But don't forget: the person next to you might be a monster imitating a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Beware the contaminated rain</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rain in this world is dangerous. Once night falls, the tram is the only shelter from it. You have to be back before midnight. Take on too much rain, and the next monster might be you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Buy and upgrade your equipment</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough and you can use the service station. Restore power to the dormant station, then buy and upgrade your equipment. Strong gear makes a real difference to survival. It isn't free, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/62c02b90805d84793f6e499307f170b9.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/62c02b90805d84793f6e499307f170b9.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/62c02b90805d84793f6e499307f170b9.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the game and join our official Discord. You'll find friends to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A microphone is required to play MIMESIS.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For the best experience, we recommend using a headset or earphones and playing with four players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >================================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>MIMESIS</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MIMESIS is a 4-player online co-op horror game where monsters imitate your friends. Gather anything of value and get back to the tram, never quite certain whether the person beside you is a real friend or a monster wearing their face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=1084 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/fb61793845c89659e03e2578252505bd.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Trust your friends. But doubt them.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Threats are scattered all through the building. Together with your friends you can push past the danger and haul your findings back safely. But don't forget: the person next to you might be a monster imitating a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/4bb26e2f2804f33cb0f40230396d9d1f.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Beware the contaminated rain</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rain in this world is dangerous. Once night falls, the tram is the only shelter from it. You have to be back before midnight. Take on too much rain, and the next monster might be you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/aead429acd6ac5ed34578dada680c184.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Buy and upgrade your equipment</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect enough and you can use the service station. Restore power to the dormant station, then buy and upgrade your equipment. Strong gear makes a real difference to survival. It isn't free, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/62c02b90805d84793f6e499307f170b9.poster.avif?t=1789122088\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/62c02b90805d84793f6e499307f170b9.webm?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827200/extras/62c02b90805d84793f6e499307f170b9.mp4?t=1789122088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join us</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the game and join our official Discord. You'll find friends to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
